Audit only the supplied orders with a permissive plausibility standard. Do not audit diversity, catalog coverage, the number of orders, omitted groups, omitted fields, or alternative permutations.

For every order_id, check only that:
1. the three fields can coexist and be observed in at least one realistic decision situation in the supplied scenario;
